Package: trl-termux
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: pytorch-termux, transformers-termux, python-pip, datasets-termux, accelerate-termux, python-pyarrow, python-pandas
Recommends: peft-termux
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: TRL (Transformer Reinforcement Learning) for Termux
 HuggingFace TRL: SFT, DPO, PPO, GRPO and friends for training
 language models on a phone (CPU). apt installs torch, transformers,
 pyarrow and pandas; the install step pip-installs datasets and trl.
 Commands: trl-check, trl-setup. Set TRL_SKIP_SETUP=1 during apt
 install to skip the setup (run trl-setup later).
